{"about_the_game":"Both players play as either Somny &amp; Yawn, two dream detectives who investigate the mysterious nightmare that invades the Islands of Dreams. <br>To progress in their cases, Somny &amp; Yawn need to use their respective skills to solve puzzles. Find clues as Somny spread across the environment while Yawn interrogates the inhabitants. Both characters must help each other out!<br><strong>Somny &amp; Yawn: Dream Detectives</strong> is a short game made for two players simultaneously, so invite a friend or a family member to fully enjoy the experience.<br><strong>Somny &amp; Yawn: Dream Detectives</strong> was made by a group of students.<br>\u2003<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1245060/extras/b10a422b71e6a1efe66aac0c1820160f.poster.avif?t=1700910305\" width=110 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1245060/extras/b10a422b71e6a1efe66aac0c1820160f.webm?t=1700910305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Asymmetrical cooperative multiplayer investigation system.<br></li><li>Players control two playable characters with different characteristics and skills.<br></li><li>Solve puzzles as a team.<br></li><li>Discover an engaging story full of colorful characters and dreamy islands.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1245060/extras/29bc20eeb1d9eaf3c6d165cd4772360a.poster.avif?t=1700910305\" width=110 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1245060/extras/29bc20eeb1d9eaf3c6d165cd4772360a.webm?t=1700910305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","backgroun